Conclusion:


- Signal forms bring a new way to build forms in Angular, based on signals and with a fresh
    approach to validation and reactivity. They offer a lot of interesting features that make
    building forms easier and more enjoyable than before.

- Among the benefits, 🔥the type safety is better than before; 🔥cross-field validation is easier
    to implement (no need to use FormGroup anymore); and 🔥building custom form components is
    simpler as well (FormValueControl is much simpler than ControlValueAccessor).